    "wacc_rationale": "Cost of equity, not WACC: the flow is post-funding-cost equity cash, so it is discounted at CoE. AUD 10y govt ~4.4% + beta ~1.5 x 6.0% AUD ERP = ~13.4%, rounded to 13.0% because the bear scenario carries the credit-cycle risk explicitly (risk charged once, same rate every scenario).",
